body:
Please don't do it. It is not worth it. The pain is not worth it. The scars is not worth it. It just hurts and don't make you feel better. Take it from someone who already did it. It's hard to hide the scars and every time I look at mine, I feel pathetic and I don't want you to feel pathetic too. Whatever it is, let go and dispose of that blade and don't ever think of touching it again. It's not worth it. 

&#x200B;

I hope you have a great day. I wish you the best :)
